    "Extracted by cmd/mocapref from mocap/cmu-114/114_11.amc, 11.00–21.00 s, keyframes every 0.25 s; pelvis lean and height from the root; hip = −femur rx, knee = tibia rx, ankle = -1 × foot rx; all relative to the subject's standing pose (20.5–21.2 s)."
